
@api = http://localhost:5081

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Chao nguoi dung
GET {{api}}/hello/An

### 3. Chao tieng Anh
GET {{api}}/hello/An?language=en

### 4. Tao loi chao
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Binh"
}

### 5. Kiem tra ten rong
POST {{api}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": ""
}
